#: ../../source/object.pick_README.md:36
msgid ""
"[get-value](https://www.npmjs.com/package/get-value): Use property paths "
"(`a.b.c`) to get a nested value from an object. | "
"[homepage](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/get-value \"Use property "
"paths (`a.b.c`) to get a nested value from an object.\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/object.pick_README.md:37
msgid ""
"[mixin-deep](https://www.npmjs.com/package/mixin-deep): Deeply mix the "
"properties of objects into the first object. Like merge-deep, but doesn't"
" clone. | [homepage](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/mixin-deep \"Deeply"
" mix the properties of objects into the first object. Like merge-deep, "
"but doesn't clone.\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/object.pick_README.md:38
msgid ""
